From: C4risrocks <C4risrocks@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 05:39:34 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?gpu:=20M1.0=20present=20parity=20=E2=80=94=20th?=
 =?UTF-8?q?e=20game's=20screens=20through=20Metal,=20and=20M2=20polish?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

MetalPresenter drives the whole present: screen images become Metal
textures (replaceRegion), the shared place() layout builds the quads,
one MSL pipeline draws them on the CAMetalLayer. the AGX driver wrote
fresh Private textures into a faulting compressed-contents path on
macOS 26.5 (KERN_INVALID at 0x4000 deep in convertTiles2D): the
descriptor now sets AllowGPUOptimizedContents(false) with Managed
storage — linear writes, faster uploads, no fault. settings gain
renderer: metal (toml + menus combo), companions open by the main
window's renderer kind, and 189-program MSL path stayed from M0.5.
native_smoke (repo) adds single-metal and shared-metal: 7/7 scenarios
green at 60.2 fps.
